usage: metrics_analyze [-h] [--input INPUT] --output-dir OUTPUT_DIR
                       --trial-context TRIAL_CONTEXT

Analyze a bounded RoboTest capture into the sole Phase 3 verdict.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --input INPUT         analysis-request JSON; omit only for a context-
                        declared infrastructure failure
  --output-dir OUTPUT_DIR
  --trial-context TRIAL_CONTEXT
                        immutable trial-context JSON created before trial
                        mutation
